abstract: "Navigation, route-map, citation, provenance, and current-status index for the Gauged Constant Vacuum-Mode (GCV) framework. References include current, proposed, conditional, superseded, and historical records; the authoritative scientific objects remain the versioned DOI records and associated Zenodo/OSF archives."
